"(e.g., 'XZWYZXLIPXDOLR-UHFFFAOYSA-N' for metformin, 'BSYNRYMUTXBXSQ-"
"UHFFFAOYSA-N' for aspirin). Also accepts ChEMBL ID (e.g., 'CHEMBL1431')."
msgstr ""

